e is swallowed | lz4file.c:325-340 |\n| 104 | `LZ4F_writeClose` | `LZ4F_compressEnd` fails | `goto out`: state freed, that error returned | lz4file.c:326-331 |\n| 105 | `LZ4F_writeClose` | short `fwrite` of the frame footer | `LZ4F_ERROR_io_write` | lz4file.c:333-335 |\n| 106 | `LZ4_compressBound` | `isize < 0` or `isize > LZ4_MAX_INPUT_SIZE` (0x7E000000) | `0` (macro `LZ4_COMPRESSBOUND` compares as `unsigned`) | lz4.c:751; lz4.h:214-215 |\n| 107 | `LZ4_compress_generic` (all `LZ4_compress_*` entry points) | `(U32)srcSize > LZ4_MAX_INPUT_SIZE` — including any negative `srcSize` | `0` | lz4.c:1360 |\n| 108 | `LZ4_compress_generic` | `srcSize == 0` and `dstCapacity <= 0` (limited/fillOutput modes) | `0` | lz4.c:1361-1362 |\n| 109 | `LZ4_compress_generic` | `srcSize == 0`, `src == NULL`, `dstCapacity >= 1` | `1` (writes a single zero token byte) — success, not an error | lz4.c:1361-1371 |\n| 110 | `LZ4_compress_generic_validated` | `outputDirective == fillOutput` and `maxOutputSize < 1` | `0` | lz4.c:985 |\n| 111 | `LZ4_compress_generic_validated` | `limitedOutput` and the literal run would overflow `dst` | `0` (hash table left populated but valid) | lz4.c:1113-1116 |\n| 112 | `LZ4_compress_generic_validated` | `limitedOutput` and the match-length encoding would overflow `dst` | `0` | lz4.c:1207-1210 |\n| 113 | `LZ4_compress_generic_validated` | `limitedOutput` and the last-literals run would overflow `dst` | `0` | lz4.c:1311-1314 |\n| 114 | `LZ4_compress_default` / `LZ4_compress_fast` | `dstCapacity < LZ4_compressBound(srcSize)` and the data is incompressible enough not to fit | `0` | lz4.c:1472-1475, 1395-1401, 1116 |\n| 115 | `LZ4_compress_fast` (LZ4_HEAPMODE=1) | `ALLOC(sizeof(LZ4_stream_t))` fails | `0` | lz4.c:1456-1458 |","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fbbc4e99-c89f-4b88-83bb-165c018df800","uuid":"6d3b4621-3e3a-4ae8-8ef5-fd33d29d992c","timestamp":"2026-09-04T03:32:07.745Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"311 ERRORS.md\n236\n# ERRORS.md 